r', 'Steam Vents', 'Step Right Up', 'Stiltstrider', 'Stomping Ground', 'Storybook Ride', 'Strength-Testing Hammer', 'Super-Duper Lost', 'Surprise Party', 'Swamp', 'Swinging Ship', 'Sword-Swallowing Seraph', 'T.A.P.P.E.R.', 'Tchotchke Elemental', 'Temple Garden', 'The Big Top', 'The Most Dangerous Gamer', 'The Space Family Goblinson', 'The Superlatorium', 'Ticket Turbotubes', 'Ticketomaton', 'Ticking Mime Bomb', 'Trapeze Artist', 'Trash Bin', 'Treacherous Trapezist', 'Trigger Happy', 'Trivia Contest', 'Truss, Chief Engineer', 'Tug of War', 'Tunnel of Love', 'Tusk and Whiskers', 'Unlawful Entry', "Urza's Fun House", 'Vedalken Squirrel-Whacker', 'Vegetation Abomination', 'Vorthos, Steward of Myth', 'Water Gun Balloon Game', 'Watery Grave', 'Wee Champion', 'Well Done', 'Wicker Picker', 'Xenosquirrels', '_____ Balls of Fire', '_____ Bird Gets the Worm', '_____ Goblin', '_____ _____ Rocketship', '_____ _____ _____ Trespasser', '_____-o-saurus']
